g?t=1746126142","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653850/c65084522dc96f8c0059e3152d8baf33c142b4c0/ss_c65084522dc96f8c0059e3152d8baf33c142b4c0.600x338.jpg?t=1746126142"}],"short_description":"A cozy rogue-like adventure about spirits, spellcraft, and second chances. You are the proud new owner of a once thriving, now dilapidated antique shop! After your arrival, it\u2019s quite obvious that something is wrong\u2026 but none of the remaining town folk can figure out what...","steam_appid":3653850,"support_info":{"email":"socials@harakkastudio.com","url":"https://discord.gg/7qssbs3wyS"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}